flowchart TD
    A[User types a plain request] --> B{Classify and route the request}
    B -->|Quick action| C[Handle it right away]
    B -->|Multi-step task| D[Plan and research the task]
    B -->|Compliance or tax question| E[Check compliance knowledge]
    C --> F[Pull real numbers from records]
    D --> F
    E --> F
    F --> G[Prepare a reviewable draft]
    G --> H{Does this touch real data?}
    H -->|Yes, sensitive| I[Hold for your approval]
    I -->|Needs changes| G
    I -->|Approved| J[Complete the action]
    H -->|No, just information| J
    J --> K[Remember it for next time]
